<br>
QAIMO'N MEIN SHAHE DEE'N KE EK HASHR SA HAI BARPA.<br>
<br>
1. JIS DAM SADA E QASIM asws. MAQTAL SE AAYI SHEH KO.<br>
<br>
MAIDA'N MEIN DAUDE SARWAR asws. KEHTE HUE YEH DEKHO.<br>
<br>
ABBAS asws. AUR AKBAR asws. AB RAN KO JALD POHONCHO.<br>
<br>
TAB TAK HASSAN asws. KA DILBAR PAAMAL HO CHUKA THA.<br>
<br>
<br>
2. ALLAH KYA GAZAB KA ASHOOR KA WO DIN THA.<br>
<br>
DULHAN BANI THI KUBRA sa. QASIM asws. BANA THA DULHA.<br>
<br>
KARNE JIHAAD RAN KO POHONCHA HASSAN asws. KA BETA.<br>
<br>
SHIDDAT KI TISHNAGI MEIN KAB TAK SAHEGA HAMLA<br>
<br>
3. PANI KAHA'N SE LAAYE SHIDDAT KI TISHNAGI MEIN.<br>
<br>
SHARBAT BANAYE KAISE SHADI KI IS QUSHI MEIN.<br>
<br>
KAISA YEH GHAM HAI AAYA KUBRA sa. KI ZINDAGI MEIN.<br>
<br>
LAMHO'N KA EK DULHA APNI DULHAN SE BICHDA.<br>
<br>
<br>
4. SHADI KI JAA PA MATAM SHADI KA HO RAHA HAI.<br>
<br>
ODHE HUE WO DULHAN MAILI SI EK RIDA HAI.<br>
<br>
QUSHIYO'N KA HAAYE PAL MEIN MANZAR BADAL GAYA HAI.<br>
<br>
AANSOO BAHA RAHI HAI SAR KO JHUKAYE KUBRA sa.<br>
<br>
<br>
5. THI MAA KI YEH WASIYAT ZINDA NA RAN SE AANA.<br>
<br>
AY MERE LAAL APNA WAADA NA BHOOL JAANA.<br>
<br>
BABA KI AB NIYABAT TUMKO HI HAI NIBHANA.<br>
<br>
ZINDA TO JAA RAHE HO QAIME MEIN AAYE LAASHA.<br>
<br>
7. POHONCHE JO SHAH RAN KO MUSHKIL KI WO GHADI THI.<br>
<br>
MAIDAN E KARBALA MEIN QUSHBOO GULO'N KI MEHKI.<br>
<br>
BIKHRI HUI JO RAN MEIN SEHRE KI HAR KALI THI.<br>
<br>
APNI ABAA MEIN LAASHA CHUNTE HAI SHAHE WAALA.<br>
<br>
8. DEKHI GAYI NA SHADI AISI KOI JAHA'N MEIN.<br>
<br>
HAR EK BARATI JISKA MASROOF HAI FUGH'AN MEIN. <br>
<br>
CHAAYA SOHAIL AISA GHAM ARZ AUR SAMA MEIN.<br>
<br>
